{%- comment -%}
  Junip star rating summary.

  Renders the element Junip's widget script hydrates into stars and a review
  count. The script and store key come from the Junip app embed (Theme settings
  → App embeds → Junip), so they are deliberately not repeated here — loading
  junip_shopify.js a second time re-initialises every widget on the page.

  The rating metafields are passed through so the stars render at their final
  size on first paint instead of popping in once the widget has fetched.

  Accepts:
  - product  {Object} product to show the rating for
  - fallback {String} optional text to show when there is no product to rate
    (product-grid cards can be configured without linking a product)

  Usage:
  {% render 'junip-product-summary', product: product %}
{%- endcomment -%}

{%- if product != blank -%}
  <span
    class="junip-product-summary"
    data-product-id="{{ product.id }}"
    data-product-rating-count="{{ product.metafields.junip.rating_count }}"
    data-product-rating-average="{{ product.metafields.junip.rating_average }}"
  ></span>
{%- elsif fallback != blank -%}
  {{ fallback | escape }}
{%- endif -%}
